e_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p007","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p013","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p014","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p020","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"}],"rationale":"樂閒明示為樂毅子，樂叔明示為孫，不補闕代父親；樂乘為樂閒宗不補兄弟。燕王喜來書及趙襄王君序各限本段，曹相國未見名字不回填。河上丈人至蓋公師承不作父子。依本篇明示姓名、君序與來書答書範圍暫接；燕惠王來書寡人指惠王、將軍指樂毅，樂毅答書先王指昭王、足下君王指惠王。伍子胥引古首吳王指闔閭，後吳王在夫差賜鴟夷後指夫差。父兄與群臣不補具體親屬，王齊為反間假說不作授王爵。"},{"id":"d-shiji082-008","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","surfaces":["惠王","燕王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-082-tiandan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p002","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/082.json"}],"rationale":"依9段明示姓名、君序與復齊事件暫接；法章立齊王與襄王迎莒、末段立襄王依同一復國敘事接。嬓女太史氏女君王后按明示，嬓與女先處完整稱謂。假神師是未名卒、臣其自稱，君指田單；燕將未名不盲接騎劫，宗族不補父母。誘王蠋授將被固謝，不當實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji080-hui","person_ids":["5pw_05i_uhv_A"],"canonical_person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-034-yan","c-shiji-080-leyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p027","mention_ids":["c-shiji-034-yan:m027-0000"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/034.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p004","mention_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0041","c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0045","c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0101","c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0135","c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0164"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"}],"rationale":"兩篇惠王太子時與樂毅不快、即位疑毅、使騎劫代將、毅走趙，國別王稱及連續特定事件支持同指。 各篇原字、原文與已發ID保留，同書不視為獨立見證；同指不確證所有紀年、任職、親屬或敘事，不按全域同名批量改號。","reviewer